	(text "Passband 70 cm (430-440 MHz). Values chosen with a part-loss simulation (see ../uhf/uhf-response.svg).\nC: C0G/NP0 0402, 50 V.  L: high-Q air-core or ceramic 0402 chip inductors, 2-5 %.\nShunt-C first: C1-L1-C2-L2-C3-L3-C4. Max about 2 W (this is a harmonic filter for the radio's 1 W).\nJ1 is an SMA male plug (threaded coupling nut) that mates with the carrier's SMA jack; J2 is a jack for the antenna's plug." (at 22.86 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ca95b276-1aba-40ed-a300-175dff7a59b3"))
